---
const id = "cloudflare-operating-model";
---
<figure class="ops-figure" aria-labelledby={`${id}-caption`}>
  <div class="ops-grid">
    <section class="ops-side ops-before" aria-labelledby={`${id}-before`}>
      <p class="ops-kicker">A typical self-managed stack</p>
      <h3 id={`${id}-before`}>You operate the plumbing</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><span>Compute</span><strong>VM or container host</strong></li>
        <li><span>Application</span><strong>Web server and process manager</strong></li>
        <li><span>Database</span><strong>Database server, backups, failover</strong></li>
        <li><span>Media</span><strong>Object storage plus a separate CDN</strong></li>
        <li><span>Background work</span><strong>Queue, worker pool and scheduler</strong></li>
        <li><span>Operations</span><strong>Logs, metrics, alerts and patching</strong></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="ops-footer">
        Each box is another service to size, secure, patch, monitor and recover.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="ops-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>App Composer removes the plumbing</span>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 48 24" width="48" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M2 12h42"></path>
        <path d="m36 6 8 6-8 6"></path>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <section class="ops-side ops-after" aria-labelledby={`${id}-after`}>
      <p class="ops-kicker">App Composer on Cloudflare</p>
      <h3 id={`${id}-after`}>You own the product</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><span>Compute</span><strong>Workers, managed by Cloudflare</strong></li>
        <li><span>Application</span><strong>One Worker per independently owned app</strong></li>
        <li><span>Database</span><strong>D1 with versioned migrations in source</strong></li>
        <li><span>Media</span><strong>R2 behind a Worker binding, free egress</strong></li>
        <li><span>Background work</span><strong>Cron trigger or no schedule at all</strong></li>
        <li><span>Operations</span><strong>Workers observability, <code>/healthz</code>, release receipts</strong></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="ops-footer">
        Source, configuration, data, owner decisions and release evidence stay yours.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
  <figcaption id={`${id}-caption`}>
    The comparison is about operating responsibility, not identical feature parity.
    A team with unusual runtime, network or data-residency needs may still require
    a different architecture. Cloudflare’s limits, pricing and service behaviour
    remain part of the design.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ops-figure {
    margin: 32px 0 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .ops-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .ops-side {
    min-width: 0;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-top: 18px;
  }
  .ops-after {
    border-top-color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .ops-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .ops-side h3 {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }
  .ops-side ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: none;
  }
  .ops-side li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 7.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 11px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .ops-side li span {
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .ops-side li strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .ops-footer {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    max-width: 42ch;
  }
  .ops-arrow {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    min-width: 120px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .ops-arrow span {
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    max-width: 10ch;
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 22px;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 78ch;
  }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .ops-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
    }
    .ops-arrow {
      min-width: 0;
      flex-direction: row;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .ops-arrow span {
      max-width: none;
    }
    .ops-arrow svg {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
    }
    .ops-side li {
      grid-template-columns: 6.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .ops-figure {
      padding: 18px;
    }
    .ops-side li {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2px;
    }
  }
</style>
